        "slc_30f9cba236d38f79475cbb35072807847570cb0c4f07d5c53e0f89ecdb15b97f"
      ],
      "text": "The project's stated design philosophy is simplicity: let the LLM CLI run in the terminal without agents, MCP, or IDE integration, which the README says would consume context."
    },
