        "slc_2c2fb56d150e10c3560e78b28a88dedbbdc8981122e5d528ef5a4bb3584d3c63"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions are workspace-aware: the session is keyed to the Doom/Perspective workspace and the tool's cwd defaults to the project's git root, enabling separate sessions per workspace in a monorepo."
    },
