      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_10383525a74d03576fe14a40fd0737921ecba9407e3d9b8be78f65d7b294d61f"
      ],
      "text": "The start-session submenu offers a -d switch to skip permissions (--dangerously-skip-permissions or equivalent) when launching a tool."
    },
